Falsifies `e1000e::proofs::one_receive_examines_at_most_one_lap_of_the_ring`.

The defect: the receive loop loses its per-call limit, so one call examines descriptors until one
reads as not yet written or a frame is delivered, however many laps of the ring that takes.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!` on the count of status words read, at the seventeenth read.

